hose who had financed the trip and selling other sets to private collectors, herbaria, and universities. If we look only at a neatly typed catalog of plants collected on an expedition, it ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.swcoloradowildflowers.com/biographies%20of%20naturalists.htm\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d9\"},\"ref\":\"d9\",\"snippet\":\" ... Steve Young\\n\\n- Cumming Nature Center Plant List – by Suzanne Cordell Strakosh\\n\\n- New York People / New York Plants – Barbara Bedford, Cornell University\\n\\n- June Field Trip Valcour Island – announcement\\n\\n- Willow Workshop – announcement\\n\\n- Publication News – some of the recent publications that are pertinent to NYS botany\\n\\nVolume 14 - 2003\\n\\n- Rediscovery of ... \",\"title\":\"https://nyflora.org/mitchelliana/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d13\"},\"ref\":\"d13\",\"snippet\":\" ... chemistry at Brigham Young University. She had two children and when they were in school she obtained a master's degree in botany and was hired as the assistant curator of plants at the BYU Herbarium. She took numerous field trips collecting plant specimens for use in teaching ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.calflora.net/botanicalnames/pageT.html\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d14\"},\"ref\":\"d14\",\"snippet\":\" ... Petiver soon had many plants in cultivation, describing and illustrating them in his publications.\\n\\nAs the seventeenth century passed into the eighteenth, the natural sciences divided into a series of more specialized fields, botany diverging from zoology, and taxonomy from medicine. Many talented individuals became interested in understanding ... \",\"title\":\"http://www.plantsystematics.org/reveal/pbio/usda/fnach7.html\"}],\"next_step\":\"Inspect navigation; read a relevant page or change the locating clue.\",\"observation\":{\"first_delivered_source_round\":null,\"prior_deliveries\":0,\"query_key\":\"166927ad7a3235cce6e1ad23a781b884d3d52b1530fdbf8ed4e9876cc48edc6c\",\"replay_requested\":false,\"result_fingerprint\":\"23ae37253a0d8f70abb3136a8bf4b6bd8312685910cd12f6d5241854c2e52f58\",\"semantic_progress\":\"not_measured\"},\"query\":\"Queen Arwa University botany department field trip plants\",\"view\":\"full\"},{\"cached\":false,\"hits\":[{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[{\"end\":2180,\"ref\":\"e1\",\"start\":0}],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d16\"},\"ref\":\"d16\",\"snippet\":\" ... Queen Arwa University Celebrates another achievement:Graduation ceremony held [Archives:2003/645/Community]\\ndate: 2003-06-26\\n---\\nQueen Arwa University Celebrates another achievement:Graduation ceremony held [Archives:2003/645/Community]\\n\\nQueen Arwa University's graduation ceremony of the fourth batch, also named the \\\"unity and democracy batch\\\", from ... \",\"title\":\"https://yementimes.com/queen-arwa-university-celebrates-another-achievementgraduation-ceremony-held-archives2003-645-community/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d25\"},\"ref\":\"d25\",\"snippet\":\" ... Queen Arwa University\\n\\nQueen Arwa University is a Yemeni private university founded in 1996 in Yemen and named after Queen Arwa.Queen Arwa UniversityQueen Arwa University | Ranking & Review The university's different fields of study include humanities and social sciences, commercial sciences and administration, engineering, science, higher education ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Queen_Arwa_University\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[{\"end\":2464,\"ref\":\"e2\",\"start\":0}],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d24\"},\"ref\":\"d24\",\"snippet\":\" ... Sector Chairman, Abdulghani al-Shameri said that the Queen Arwa University has done its spare no efforts to hold such activities for the benefit of the Palestinians.\\n\\nWe are hoping that other universities will follow the example of the Queen Arwa University, in highlighting the Palestinian issue to ... \",\"title\":\"https://yementimes.com/arwa-university-holds-annual-cultural-activities-archives2002-20-local-news-3/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d39\"},\"ref\":\"d39\",\"snippet\":\" ... There were 100,000 paid tickets for the ceremony, with around 200,000 free tickets. The next month an exact amount of 326,000 tickets was stated, with 104,000 paid tickets for the lowest bank and 222,000 free tickets for the higher banks. The free tickets ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2024_Summer_Olympics_opening_ceremony\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d36\"},\"ref\":\"d36\",\"snippet\":\" ... The artist who captured the soul of the US\\n\\nBBC, Arwa Haider Jul 3, 2019As a new exhibition of art by Faith Ringgold opens in London, the 88-year-old talks to Arwa Haider about her early life and how she created subversive works with postage stamps and ... \",\"title\":\"https://acagalleries.com/artists/faith-ringgold/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d40\"},\"ref\":\"d40\",\"snippet\":\" ... Colonial- era records indicate that the region produced over 11 million cacao beans in annual tribute to the Spanish authorities, not including any grown for local consumption. Chocolate was used in ancient Mesoamerica not only to make a ceremonial beverage, but as currency in market transactions and tribute ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.penn.museum/sites/expedition/the-mystery-of-queen-of-la-florida-namaan/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d41\"},\"ref\":\"d41\",\"snippet\":\" ... We sincerely hope the public will enjoy this fitting tribute to the great legends of hockey.\\\"\\n\\nHoused within the historic bank building at the corner of Yonge and Front Streets, the Esso Great Hall features the re-design and re-configuration of the interior exhibition space for improved ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.hhof.com/general/ourhistory.html\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d42\"},\"ref\":\"d42\",\"snippet\":\" ... Installed in 1905, this limestone clock tower is the university's best-known landmark. It sits atop Grant Hall, a 900-seat auditorium used for public lectures, concerts, convocation ceremonies, dances and exams. Named after George Monro Grant, principal of Queen's from 1877 until his death in ... \",\"title\":\"https://universityaffairs.ca/features/a-brief-history-of-clock-towers-on-canadian-university-campuses/\"}],\"next_step\":\"Inspect navigation; read a relevant page or change the locating clue.\",\"observation\":{\"first_delivered_source_round\":null,\"prior_deliveries\":0,\"query_key\":\"6d8da39c65b6965e1cee76abef22135b7f507f686791b5ea47ba1b4b62dcbcdd\",\"replay_requested\":false,\"result_fingerprint\":\"d30cb751936f3f5d914412f42e38cf82e5de2e181784a3e7e920232ba9313765\",\"semantic_progress\":\"not_measured\"},\"query\":\"Queen Arwa University bank ceremony tribute\",\"view\":\"full\"}]}","role":"tool","tool_call_id":"call_556a7f7de8b24e06854813